#, no-wrap
msgid "zlib (zlib RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "zlib (zlib RPM untuk OS serasi RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Libraries and header files needed for Python development (python3.1x-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "Perpustakaan dan fail pengepala yang diperlukan untuk pembangunan Python (python3.1x-devel RPM untuk OS serasi RHEL)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the Rust/C API library with the following commands wherever you have saved the QRMI repository.\n"
msgstr "Bina perpustakaan API Rust/C dengan arahan berikut di mana sahaja anda menyimpan repositori QRMI.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To build the Python package, first set up a Python environment and install the required dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Untuk membina pakej Python, mulakan dengan menyediakan persekitaran Python dan memasang kebergantungan yang diperlukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the stub files for the Python code.\n"
msgstr "Cipta fail stub untuk kod Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lastly, build the Python wheels for distribution to your hosts.\n"
msgstr "Akhirnya, bina wheel Python untuk diedarkan kepada hos anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The wheel is created in the `./target/release/maturin/wheels` directory. You can distribute and install on your hosts by `pip install <wheel>`.\n"
msgstr "Wheel dicipta dalam direktori `./target/release/maturin/wheels`. Anda boleh mengedarkan dan memasangnya pada hos anda dengan `pip install <wheel>`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging {#logging}"
msgstr "Pengelogan {#logging}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QRMI supports [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) for logging. You can find the detailed QRMI runtime logs by specifying `RUST_LOG` environment variable with the log level. Supported levels are `error`, `warn`, `info`, `debug`, and `trace`. The default level is `warn`. \n"
msgstr "QRMI menyokong [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) untuk pengelogan. Anda boleh mencari log masa jalan QRMI terperinci dengan menentukan pemboleh ubah persekitaran `RUST_LOG` dengan tahap log. Tahap yang disokong ialah `error`, `warn`, `info`, `debug`, dan `trace`. Tahap lalai ialah `warn`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you specify `trace`, you can find underlying HTTP transaction logs.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda menentukan `trace`, anda boleh mencari log transaksi HTTP yang mendasari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example logs:\n"
msgstr "Contoh log:\n"

